<title>HONG KONG: Bank of E.Asia to open Taiwan branch.</title>
<headline>Bank of E.Asia to open Taiwan branch.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of East Asia Ltd will open its first Taiwan branch in May, Daniel Wan, the banking group's deputy general manager and chief financial officer, told reporters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong-based bank said last year it planned to open a branch in Taipei in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
